From: 0racl-lab <360770237+0racl-lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:41:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Add oracle interface ContentRead (7)

Read a file named by the SHA-256 of its bytes: its size, a byte range (up to
512 bytes) or one JSON field in RFC 8785 canonical form. The locator (IPFS CID
or Arweave id) is only a hint; the hash decides. Fee 50 QU + 10 QU per started
MiB of maxFileSize (max 64 MiB). Registered at index 7; 4 tests added to
test/oracle_engine.cpp. Reference service: oracle-machine oracles/read_content.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QHXGjDwxBARUytE2smA8oq
